<color=white>The gods of Suns, Moons, Stars and Clouds have blessed us with two fated heroes who will ensure this protection. Bonded by the Tether, they will journey beyond the valley and vanquish the darkness.</color>
~CalculateEventResults()
++[Go forth. #EdrickContinue]
->END

EXTERNAL CalculateEventResults()